{"key":"enterprise/T1546.009","id":"T1546.009","name":"AppCert DLLs","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1546","tactics":["persistence","privilege-escalation"],"platforms":["Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may establish persistence and/or elevate privileges by executing malicious content triggered by AppCert DLLs loaded into processes. Dynamic-link libraries (DLLs) that are specified in the AppCertDLLs Registry key under HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\ are loaded into every process that calls the ubiquitously used application programming interface (API) functions CreateProcess, CreateProcessAsUser,…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/009","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--7d57b371-10c2-45e5-b3cc-83a8fb380e4c","source_modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:00.663Z","source_object_version":"1.1","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0016","name":"Module Load","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0016","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--c0a4a086-cc20-4e1e-b7cb-29d99dfa3fb1","page":"telemetry/DC0016/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0063","name":"Windows Registry Key Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0063","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--da85d358-741a-410d-9433-20d6269a6170","page":"telemetry/DC0063/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0362","name":"Detection Strategy for AppCert DLLs Persistence via Registry Injection","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0362","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--3de93376-739e-4842-875d-d6e9948db8d4","relationship_id":"relationship--e4e45e24-c4de-45b9-bf54-762269aec2eb"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN1029","name":